            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=xiaowei%40stratify.com",
            "name": "xiaowei@stratify.com",
            "key": "xiaowei@stratify.com",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Xiaowei Jiang",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "We need to set the path to \"/\" when user try to set it to an empty string in \nHttpMethodBase, so that the following code will work:\n\nURL url = new URL(\"http://www.cnn.com\");\nGetMethod method = new GetMethod(url.getPath());\n\nIn Java url.getPath() will return an empty string for http://www.cnn.com.\n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=xiaowei%40stratify.com",
            "name": "xiaowei@stratify.com",
            "key": "xiaowei@stratify.com",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Xiaowei Jiang",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2002-07-26T10:37:48.000+0000",
          "updated": "2002-07-26T10:37:48.000+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12333572/comment/12379220",
          "id": "12379220",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=xiaowei%40stratify.com",
            "name": "xiaowei@stratify.com",
            "key": "xiaowei@stratify.com",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
